# etude-5dr.7 implementation

Commit `ce964cf` makes caller validation topology-sensitive. Git-control snapshots now encode the resolved control path and reject remaining non-regular control/ignore files. Tracked-byte inspection `Lstat`s every ancestor and rejects symlinked or non-directory parents before opening a leaf. Two focused regressions reproduce same-byte config and tracked-parent symlink substitutions and assert no run ref is published.
